nted_pages","html":"99"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"119"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U,V\">\\(U,V\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UniversalPF}\">\\(\\mathrm{UniversalPF}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_U,K_V\">\\(K_U,K_V\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6cd902d852c2c848\" href=\"?note=6cd902d852c2c848\" title=\"43-df-prefixkolm\">43-df-prefixkolm</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall\\sigma\\in\\Sigma^*\\;|K_U(\\sigma)-K_V(\\sigma)|\\le c.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall\\sigma\\in\\Sigma^*\\;|K_U(\\sigma)-K_V(\\sigma)|\\le c.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>两个固定模拟前缀分别给出两方向复杂度界；常数独立于输出串。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 2007-07-28 草稿，§6.5, prefix-free invariance；印刷页 99，PDF 页 119。本次逐项核对陈述；下文给出笔记内论证，未作机器形式验证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-prefixkolm","status":"resolved","id":"6cd902d852c2c848","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-prefixkolm]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-universal-prefix-machine","status":"resolved","id":"f5078ab697e20add","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-universal-prefix-machine]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-prefixkolm","status":"resolved","id":"6cd902d852c2c848","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"